    // ── PR#11 list-shelf cells — `list-shelf <domain>` renders the §6
    // ingredient-shelf design-option groups per 7-verb stage, byte-for-byte
    // against the Swift listShelf(_:) reference. BOTH surfaces read the SAME
    // domains/<d>.md maps via DEMIURGE_REPO. The fixture exercises: a domain
    // WITH a §6 shelf (two verb lines in rawValue order · a `[multi]` tag ·
    // `;`-split + ` / `-join), a domain with NO §6 section (mapless render),
    // and a truly-missing domain map (same mapless render). Synthetic-fallback
    // label (== key) keeps the goldens machine-independent — like compose's
