    // ── PR#14 operate cells — `operate [list|audit]` renders the
    // OperationRegistry manifest (operation_registry.hexa) + the owner-mode
    // gate, byte-for-byte against the Swift `operate` reference. The manifest
    // is static data (no env/path), so the goldens are machine-independent —
    // owner visibility flips on DEMIURGE_OWNER / --owner, expert bracket flips
